WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.133
Okay,

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.767
a picture puzzle!

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.000
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:13.567
A.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:14.100
Top-left,

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:14.633
B.

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:15.167
Bottom-right,

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:15.700
C.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.267
Center,

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:17.333
or D.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:17.867
Top-right?

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:18.967
Five seconds!

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.933
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.267
The answer is...

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:28.833
B,

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:29.400
bottom-right!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.633
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:33.333
corner to corner:

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:33.867
top-right,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.433
top-left,

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:35.000
bottom-left,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.367
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:39.900
So,

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.933
are you smart or fart?

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:44.367
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:45.567
find your rank!

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:47.067
So,

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.467
how did you do?

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.833
Comment your score below,

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.200
and follow for more!
